The paper never discusses chemoselectivity.
It simply describes the ring-opening of cyclohexene oxide by cyanate catalyzed by HHDH. 
There is no comparison with other functional groups, so chemoselectivity cannot be inferred.
The paper focuses on regio- and stereochemical outcomes, not chemoselectivity.

"regioselectivity" is almost correct, but is is wrongly written.

